WEBVTT

apply-3
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
Konzani timizere ta Steri-Strip, tepi yomata, chophimba chofewa, chotetezera diso ndi lumo.

apply-4
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:17.850
Fotokozani zimene muchite ndipo pemphani chilolezo.

apply-6
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:22.900
Pemphani wodwala kuti atseke zikope zonse mofatsa.

apply-7
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:29.850
Ikani kamzere pa chikope chakumtunda. Kokani pansi kuti zikope zitseke, ndipo matani pa chikope chapansi ndi patsaya.

apply-8
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.650
Gwiritsani timizere tiwiri kapena titatu.

apply-9
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:40.150
Kenako ikani tepi pa chophimba chofewa. Tepi ikhale yaitali kuwirikiza kawiri kapena katatu utali wa chophimbacho.

apply-11
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:47.150
Ikani chophimba chokhala ndi tepi pa zikope zotsekedwa ndipo matani pamphumi.

apply-12
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:50.350
Onjezerani zidutswa ziwiri kapena zitatu za tepi.

apply-13
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:54.250
Pomaliza, ikani tepi pa chotetezera cholimba.

apply-14
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:58.800
Ikani chotetezera pamwamba pa chophimba chofewa ndipo chimateni pamphumi ndi patsaya.

apply-15
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.700
Ikani tepi yachiwiri.
